   SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

   The system folders carry a translation key, not a label - core/folder.go says
   why: the name is an S3 prefix and must never be translated, or a client in
   another language stops finding the mail a colleague filed.

   A folder somebody made themselves is not in here, and NSLocalizedString
   answers with the key it was given. So "Rechnungen" comes back as
   "Rechnungen", which is exactly right. */

